<title>USA: Compumed says CEO no longer with company.</title>
<headline>Compumed says CEO no longer with company.</headline>
<dateline>MANHATTAN BEACH, Calif. 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>CompuMed Inc said Tuesday its president and chief executive Rod Raynovich is no longer associated with the company.</p>
<p>While the board conducts a search for his successor, James Linesch, Chief Financial Officer, will undertake Raynovich's duties as acting CEO, it said..</p>
<p>The company did not provide further details about Raynovich and was not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
